e": "document", "source_file": "docs/architecture/contracts/sync-protocol.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_contracts_sync_protocol_offline_queue_ack", "label": "Offline queue until ack; unacknowledged never removed", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture/contracts/sync-protocol.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_contracts_sync_protocol_snapshot_compaction", "label": "Snapshots and compaction (R-05): >500 updates or >1 MiB, and on document close after >=30 local edits", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture/contracts/sync-protocol.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Snapshots double as version-history versions (spec/06)."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_contracts_sync_protocol_client_messages", "label": "Client messages: hello, subscribe, unsubscribe, push, snapshot, awareness", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture/contracts/sync-protocol.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_contracts_sync_protocol_doc_sync_unit", "label": "Sync unit: Yjs document (account, notebook, note)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture/contracts/sync-protocol.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_contracts_sync_protocol_error_codes_limits", "label": "Error codes: bad_request, unauthorized, forbidden, doc_not_found, payload_too_large (2 MiB update / 50 MiB snapshot, decoded bytes), rate_limited, protocol_mismatch, internal", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture/contracts/sync-protocol.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_contracts_sync_protocol_guest_device_id", "label": "Guest device id: guest:<22-char hash> (fits 64-char limit)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture/contracts/sync-protocol.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_contracts_sync_protocol_last_seq_catchup", "label": "Client keeps lastSeq per document and catches up on connect", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture/contracts/sync-protocol.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_contracts_sync_protocol_no_echo_own_updates", "label": "Server does not echo client's own updates (except catch-up updates from another device)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture/contracts/sync-protocol.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_contracts_sync_protocol_per_doc_ordering", "label": "Ordering (mandatory for server): seq assignment and broadcast serialized per document; ack after write; gaps allowed", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture/contracts/sync-protocol.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Client stores lastSeq = max(seq); out-of-order delivery could lose an update on disconnect."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_contracts_sync_protocol_server_messages", "label": "Server messages: welcome, updates, update, ack, awareness, error", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture/contracts/sync-protocol.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_contracts_sync_protocol_server_seq", "label": "Server assigns seq to encrypted updates, stores and relays; does not merge or read", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture/contracts/sync-protocol.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_contracts_sync_protocol_stored_mode", "label": "Stored mode: subscribed doc kept only as merged state (Y.mergeUpdates), Y.Doc raised on open", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture/contracts/sync-protocol.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Client need not hold Y.Doc in memory; protocol unchanged (core stream clarification 2026-10-25)."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_contracts_sync_protocol_subscribe_before_push", "label": "Subscribe before first push", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture/contracts/sync-protocol.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Otherwise lastSeq = max(ack) could skip other devices' earlier updates."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_contracts_sync_protocol_websocket_transport", "label": "Transport wss://<host>/v1/sync: JSON frames with type, base64url without padding, ping/pong 25 s", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture/contracts/sync-protocol.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_contracts_sync_protocol_sync_permissions", "label": "Permissions: user - own account docs (registered via POST /v1/docs); guest - shared docs, push only with edit; agents not via WebSocket", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture/contracts/sync-protocol.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_contracts_sync_protocol_test_vectors", "label": "Sync test vectors: JSON examples of all messages (TS and Swift)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture/contracts/sync-protocol.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_contracts_sync_protocol_snapshot_on_subscribe", "label": "Subscribe with since < latest snapshot seq always returns latest snapshot + later updates", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture/contracts/sync-protocol.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Always (not only after compaction): fewer updates to apply, and a client that missed a corrupted update recovers from a later snapshot. Proposed by core stream, accepted 2026-10-26."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_contracts_sync_protocol_skip_undecryptable_item", "label": "Client skips undecryptable/unappliable item, reports {docId, seq, deviceId, reason}, may resubscribe once with since: 0", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture/contracts/sync-protocol.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_contracts_sync_protocol_history_retention_exception", "label": "Server may delete updates seq <= baseSeq except those needed by version history", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture/contracts/sync-protocol.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_contracts_sync_protocol_awareness_ephemeral", "label": "Awareness (cursors/presence): encrypted, not stored, only relayed", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture/contracts/sync-protocol.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_contracts_sync_protocol_error_ref_rule", "label":